WEBVTT

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:05.900
A Notice from the Yamayuri Council
When watching
"Maria Watches Over Us ~Printemps~,"
please have the room brightly lit and
sit well away from the television set.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:16.910
Thank you.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.050
Shimako.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:27.910
I think the time is about right
for you to officially welcome...

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:31.320
...the Rosa Gigantea en bouton
to the Rose Mansion.

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:33.450
The Rosa Gigantea en bouton?

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:35.660
Who do you mean?

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:38.160
Noriko-chan, of course. Who else?

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:39.760
Um...

00:00:41.070 --> 00:00:44.060
But it is not as if Noriko is my little sister.

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:46.270
You're kidding!

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:48.240
T-Then, what about your rosary?

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:50.240
I have not given it to her.

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:54.580
It has already been half a
month since the Maria Festival.

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:56.580
What are you dragging your feet for?

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:00.490
Do you wish to have Noriko
brought into the fold?

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:03.850
For the sake of putting the Yamayuri
Council on a solid footing,

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:08.930
the birth of the Rosa Gigantea en bouton
is being greatly anticipated.

00:01:09.530 --> 00:01:11.430
We don't mean to compel you,

00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:13.060
but that is the tradition, after all.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.440
Pardon us for being late!
Pardon us for being late!

00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:21.470
What a rush you're in.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.580
You needn't run, you know.

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:32.020
Shimako.

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:36.190
If you don't mind, why don't you have
Noriko-chan come by every so often...

00:01:36.190 --> 00:01:38.350
...to help out here with the Yamayuri Council?

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:42.350
But that's not to say that we'll force
you to make her your soeur.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.730
Noriko is no one's little sister,

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:47.890
and yet you would have her come
regularly to the Rose Mansion?

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:50.710
It is not as if that would be unprecedented.

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:52.760
We will leave it to your discretion, Shimako.

00:01:54.310 --> 00:01:57.900
This is just like a year ago, with me and...

00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:04.540
The maidens, who flock to
Maria-sama's garden,

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:09.390
pass through the tall gates today yet
again with innocent, angelic smiles.

00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:14.190
Their pure hearts and bodies are
clad in deep-colored uniforms.

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:17.060
So that the pleats of their
skirts are not disturbed...

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:20.490
...and so that their white sailor
collars are not set aflutter,

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:23.870
it is customary here to walk
slowly and with decorum.

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:29.370
The Private Lillian Girls' Academy,
a garden of maidens.

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:43.280
Maria Watches Over Us
Printemps

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:52.530
In the morning mist,
Asamoya no naka

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:59.470
the white path goes on.
tsuzuku shiroi michi

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:06.980
The birds sing.
Tori no saezuri

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:14.610
We exchange greetings.
Aisatsu kawashinagara

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:22.100
At times, the clouds hang low,
Toki ni kumo ga tarekomete

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:29.570
and the sun may grow dim.
hizashi kagerou tomo

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:37.670
But I will walk with my chin up,
Sesuji nobashite aruku

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:45.150
for I know,
watashi wa shitteru kara

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:52.190
that above those heavy clouds...
omoi kumo no ue wa

00:03:52.190 --> 00:04:00.120
...is the blue sky.
aoi sora

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:06.870
Tears of the Rosary

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:17.770
Honestly! What in the world
is Shimako thinking?

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:21.220
Now, now, you didn't settle on a little sister...

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:22.850
...until the school festival last year, too.

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:26.130
In my case,

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:29.120
it was because I did not know
of Yumi's existence until then.

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:30.400
And before Yumi,

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:33.270
I had the unpleasant experience of
being rejected by Shimako, too.

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:36.130
At the very least, I was being proactive.

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:38.970
Come to think of it, Shimako and Sei-sama...

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:41.170
...also dragged their feet for
about half a year, didn't they?

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:43.430
I wonder if it is a White Rose tradition.

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:48.150
It was because you asked
Shimako to be your soeur...

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:50.170
...that Sei-sama made up her mind, right?

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:55.980
I'll make Shimako my little sister.

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:01.380
I wonder if Shimako also needs
some kind of motivation...

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:11.040
Shimako-san.

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:14.210
What's wrong?

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:18.240
I was thinking we could go home
together, if it's all right with you.

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:21.310
Oh, yes, let's! Wow, I'm so happy!

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:23.940
What about your errands? Are you done now?

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:25.850
Errands? I didn't have any.

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:28.480
I was just running around,
because Toko was pestering me.

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:30.280
Who did you say was pestering you?

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:33.620
Good afternoon, Rosa Gigantea.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:36.290
Good afternoon, Toko-chan.

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:38.990
Please listen to this, Rosa Gigantea.

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:41.270
No matter how much I recommend it,

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:43.460
Noriko-san refuses to even go observe clubs.

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:46.730
Clubs? Noriko, are you joining a club?

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:48.800
I'm not interested in joining at all.

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:50.740
I've just been invited, that's all.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:55.410
Everyone seems eager to try to make
me fit in more at the Academy.

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:58.920
Our time in high school
may seem long, but it's not.

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:01.360
So don't you think it would be
better to have something else...

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:02.850
...to devote yourself to besides your studies?

00:06:03.220 --> 00:06:05.630
Besides the Drama Club and I,

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:08.760
the Literary Club, the Tennis Club,
and the Bible Study Club...

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:11.130
...have all extended invitations to Noriko-san.

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:12.920
The Bible Study?

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:14.530
No way, right?

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:17.870
Or are you putting off joining any clubs,

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:23.070
because you anticipate that your
time will be taken up elsewhere?

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:23.840
What?

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:33.820
Now then, I think I'll head off to my club.

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:36.750
If I don't hurry, I'll miss the vocal exercises.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:42.560
Shall we go home?

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:44.590
Yes.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:52.540
Um...
Um...

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:55.470
You go ahead, Shimako-san.

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:56.800
No, you go ahead, Noriko.

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:58.540
Then, I'll go first.

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:01.470
Toko made a weird speculation
about my motives,

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:05.450
but it's not like I'm resisting joining
any clubs because of that.

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:07.750
"Because of that"?

00:07:08.260 --> 00:07:11.780
What Toko said is kind of like
a paranoid preconception.

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:15.800
In other words, that I'm trying to stay
free of obligations or something,

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:18.130
because I expect to be working for
the Yamayuri Council in the future.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.060
Noriko...

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:22.170
Um, so don't get the wrong idea, okay?

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:25.070
There's just no club that I'm interested in.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:28.340
So, I'm thinking about just forming
my own club, once and for all.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.040
How about like a
"Society for Viewing Buddhist Statues"?

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:34.380
Noriko, do you want my rosary?

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:38.480
But you said that it wasn't the right time.

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:41.980
I thought so, but if you...

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:45.050
Did someone say something to you?

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:46.350
About me?

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:47.560
What?

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:50.930
Someone who's not even the
Rosa Gigantea's little sister,

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:52.400
always hanging around her...

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:55.560
It must be causing trouble for you, right?

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:57.840
That is not what this is about.

00:07:58.210 --> 00:07:59.810
It's okay. Don't worry about it.

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:02.380
I'm already a misfit at this school...

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:04.110
...and it seems I stand out in a weird way.

00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:05.380
Noriko...

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:09.520
I don't believe at all that
you think of me that way,

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:11.420
but when you think about it rationally,

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:13.290
I guess I've been too familiar...

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:15.760
...with someone who's idolized here at school.

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:16.690
Noriko!

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:17.790
Yes?

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:21.820
I feel that I want to spend
time with you of my own will.

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:24.260
You must know that.

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:25.760
Shimako-san...

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:26.830
Am I wrong?

00:08:27.070 --> 00:08:28.300
You're not wrong,

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:32.700
but the world isn't composed of just us two.

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:34.510
You're right.

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:37.340
Shimako-san, tell me what's really going on.

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:40.480
Rosa Chinensis and Rosa Foetida have said...

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:42.880
...that you should drop by the Rose Mansion.

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:45.090
They've extended an invitation to you.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.310
What?!

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.920
Why would I go to the Rose Mansion?

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:54.580
As long as you don't mind,
they would like for you to help out.

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:57.160
You mean, as volunteer work?

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:59.830
Well, I suppose you could call it that.

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:02.600
But are you fine with that?

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:04.700
If I weren't, I wouldn't have told you.

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:08.340
I see. Right, that makes sense.

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:09.840
All right, I'll think about it.

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:27.760
My name is Nijyo Noriko.

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:31.260
Good day. Welcome to the Rose Mansion.

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:37.530
Noriko-chan, please sit over here.

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:39.100
Would tea be fine?

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:43.510
No, thank you. Since I only came to help anyway.

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:46.370
My...

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:53.120
You can be a guest for today.

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:55.050
Here, sit down.

00:09:56.090 --> 00:09:58.080
Talk with us for today.

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:01.090
Yumi-chan, please make us some delicious tea.

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:01.950
Certainly.

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:06.070
Shimako, what are you
doing just standing there?

00:10:06.070 --> 00:10:07.000
Why don't you sit?

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:08.540
Oh, right...

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:14.400
Noriko-chan, do you want any sugar or cream?

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:15.900
Noriko, what do you want?

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:18.540
Do you want sugar and cream? Or no?

00:10:19.710 --> 00:10:20.610
I'm fine.

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:26.650
Noriko-chan, what is your family like?

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:28.150
My family?

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:32.420
Noriko is staying with her great aunt right now.

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:35.890
Her home is in Chiba,
which is too far to commute, so...

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:38.400
What are you doing answering for her?

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:40.990
Pardon me.

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:49.510
It must be lonely to be living
away from your parents.

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:53.480
Yes, but my great aunt is an alumna of Lillian,

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:56.180
so I get to hear old stories from
her and I enjoy that very much.

00:10:57.080 --> 00:10:58.680
We are not of a similar age,

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:01.810
but you could say our relationship
is like that of friends.

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:04.710
My! Friends?

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:06.630
That's so wonderful.

00:11:07.260 --> 00:11:08.460
Thank you.

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:13.000
I hope you'll continue to visit us
here at the Rose Mansion, Noriko-chan.

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:14.470
Am I allowed to come whenever?

00:11:14.470 --> 00:11:15.230
Of course!

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:17.700
You could even come here to
eat lunch during lunch time.

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:46.070
Tsutako-san...

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:49.560
I got a shot of the Rosa Gigantea sighing.

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:52.300
That kind of expression isn't bad,

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:54.840
but I like this expression better.

00:11:57.280 --> 00:11:57.900
Oh, my.

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:01.910
You looked so good, I couldn't
help myself, so I sneaked a shot.

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:04.620
If you don't mind it, I hope you'll keep it.

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:06.150
Thank you.

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.150
This first-year student with the bob cut...

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:09.420
Um...

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:10.420
Noriko?

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:13.060
Right, Noriko-chan. She's great.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:14.590
As a subject?

00:12:14.930 --> 00:12:16.060
As a reflector.

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:16.930
Reflector?

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:17.830
You know,

00:12:17.970 --> 00:12:22.130
those mirror-like boards used to
illuminate people in photography?

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:23.070
Those things.

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:25.570
Someone who shines light upon Todo Shimako.

00:12:26.610 --> 00:12:27.570
Light...

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:30.770
But it's clouded now.

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:32.740
Like today's weather.

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:34.180
Did something happen?

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:36.910
I don't even know, myself...

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:40.220
No matter what I do,
I feel like I'm getting nowhere...

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:44.950
Shimako-san, you really are
Sato Sei-sama's little sister.

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:46.120
What?

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:49.120
You're stuck in the same maze.

00:12:54.470 --> 00:12:57.230
It's probably that I'm clumsy at this.

00:12:57.740 --> 00:13:00.610
Maybe you're thinking too
hard about this, Shimako-san.

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:03.370
You're too considerate of those
around you and you get tired.

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:09.780
I guess you can see
everything clearly, can't you?

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:11.780
I'm a photographer,

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:13.180
so when I release the shutter,

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:16.380
it's my hope that I'll also
capture what's in people's hearts.

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:20.480
If I could see into people's hearts, too,

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:23.150
maybe I wouldn't agonize so much like this.

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:25.160
I think it's okay to agonize.

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:28.120
After all, there's no right answer
when it comes to relationships.

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:32.470
There might be a sample
answer out there somewhere,

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:34.730
but it would be boring to copy that straight up.

00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:36.370
You're right.

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:39.670
I have no choice but to find the answer myself.

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:51.550
Um...

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:55.190
G-Good day, Rosa Gigantea.

00:13:58.930 --> 00:13:59.460
Oh...

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:14.700
For the sake of putting the
Yamayuri Council on a solid footing,

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:18.290
the birth of the Rosa Gigantea
en bouton is being greatly anticipated.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:20.050
We don't mean to compel you,

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:20.790
but that is the tradition, after all.

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:23.260
You really are Sato Sei-sama's little sister.

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:25.520
You're stuck in the same maze.

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:28.990
The same maze...

00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:30.260
Oh...

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:32.600
Goronta?

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:35.160
Wait.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:56.350
Onee-sama...

00:14:57.160 --> 00:15:00.350
Onee-sama, when you made
me your little sister,

00:15:00.530 --> 00:15:03.590
how did you convince yourself to do so?

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:25.010
Shimako-san?

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:27.310
The tea is ready...

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:29.420
Oh, thank you.

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:39.430
Noriko-chan, could we not do something
about how you call her "Shimako-san"?

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:40.360
Pardon?

00:15:40.970 --> 00:15:43.800
It is standard here to address
upperclassmen as "sama."

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:48.130
Here at the Academy, address her as
"Shimako-sama" or " Rosa Gigantea."

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:49.630
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:54.100
These are things you should be
teaching her properly, Shimako.

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:56.880
For it is Noriko-chan who will
be embarrassed later on.

00:15:57.580 --> 00:15:59.350
I am very sorry about that.

00:15:59.690 --> 00:16:02.120
Um, I do not mind it for myself,

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:03.960
but it seems wrong that Shimako-san... I mean...

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:07.050
...that Shimako-sama should feel
the repercussions of this.

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:11.830
After all, it is not as if
Shimako-sama is my big sister!

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:12.630
Noriko!

00:16:12.730 --> 00:16:15.500
It is the duty of upperclassmen
to offer guidance...

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:17.230
...to underclassmen who have no big sisters.

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:19.870
You two have a close relationship,

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:21.080
so even if you are not sisters,

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:23.510
it is only proper that Shimako
should admonish you about it.

00:16:23.840 --> 00:16:27.050
If you do not want to be admonished
by upperclassmen in general,

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:29.210
you had better hurry up and find a big sister.

00:16:29.350 --> 00:16:30.410
That is none of your business.

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:31.850
What did you say?

00:16:31.850 --> 00:16:36.120
Onee-sama, Noriko-chan is still
unused to life at Lillian, so...

00:16:36.560 --> 00:16:39.030
Shimako, you should admonish her as well.

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:41.090
This underclassman, who is so ignorant.

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:42.460
What? But...

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:44.990
As I said, why do you keep
bringing Shimako-san into this?

00:16:45.070 --> 00:16:46.070
There you go again.

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:48.300
Not "Shimako-san." It's " Shimako-sama"!

00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:51.340
Please do not nitpick at my
words when we are fighting!

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:53.510
Fighting?! You must be joking!

00:16:53.510 --> 00:16:55.780
I am counseling an underclassman.

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:58.980
You're a mere first-year student, yet you
think you're a third-year student's equal?

00:16:58.980 --> 00:17:02.680
"Mere"?! We are only two years apart in age!

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:05.050
When you are in school, two years is significant.

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:06.750
I am against seniority systems!

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:07.810
Please stop already!

00:17:07.890 --> 00:17:08.620
I'm sorry!

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:12.680
It's all my fault! All because
I have not done my part properly,

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:15.100
I've caused you and everyone else to worry...

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:16.930
...and I'm putting a strain on Noriko.

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:18.460
So, what will you do?

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:22.160
How will you make sure that
you do not cause us to worry?

00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:25.470
How will you make sure you
do not put a strain on Noriko-chan?

00:17:25.470 --> 00:17:27.440
Would you please tell us that?

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:28.930
How?

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:31.200
There are many ways to do it, right?

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:33.550
For example, as an extreme solution,

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:37.510
this will be resolved if you sever
ties with either us or Noriko-chan.

00:17:37.920 --> 00:17:40.410
Sever ties with one or the other?

00:17:40.550 --> 00:17:42.920
Abandon your fellow
Yamayuri Council members,

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:45.160
and instead of being Rosa Gigantea,

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:47.130
you can go back to being an ordinary student...

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:50.460
...and spend your days at the
Academy with Noriko-chan, free of care.

00:17:51.970 --> 00:17:56.560
Or go back to how you were
before Noriko-chan came.

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:59.270
What will you do, Shimako?

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:04.840
I'm sorry!

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:10.010
Shimako!

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:31.530
I don't want to lose either of them...

00:18:32.410 --> 00:18:34.240
What in the world am I to do?

00:18:45.490 --> 00:18:47.780
If it starts raining in earnest,
you're going to catch a cold.

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:52.690
There's something I realized today.

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:54.790
You're a greedy person.

00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:58.290
And you don't want anyone to hate you.

00:18:58.770 --> 00:18:59.820
That's right.

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:06.670
So you've tried to keep yourself
from wanting things, haven't you?

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:08.810
Because once you have something,

00:19:08.810 --> 00:19:10.610
you become afraid of parting with it.

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:11.210
Sachiko
Yoshino
Yumi

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:12.410
Sachiko
Yoshino
Yumi
But you need those people.

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:15.070
But you need those people.

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:19.310
Don't tell me to cut ties with you,
just because that's true.

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:20.750
I won't.

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:24.320
Because I'm of the conceited
opinion that you need me, too.

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:26.650
Hasty Shimako-san.

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:31.220
Rosa Chinensis only gave
you an extreme example.

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:34.030
If you don't want to let go,

00:19:34.030 --> 00:19:36.330
I don't think you need to force
yourself to discard either.

00:19:36.470 --> 00:19:38.270
But that's...

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:41.140
Hold on to your friends with one hand...

00:19:41.140 --> 00:19:43.540
...and hold on to me with your other hand.

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:56.520
Let me borrow this rosary.

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:58.950
What? Borrow?

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:03.230
That's something that's
very precious to you, right?

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:17.370
But to me, it's nothing but a bauble.

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:22.820
I don't understand the weight of this rosary,

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:24.550
so it probably won't wear on me.

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:26.850
Maybe you could take the rosary off for a while,

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:29.080
consider it letting me borrow it,
and unburden yourself.

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:32.020
Let you borrow the rosary...

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:34.160
Yes, just like the prayer beads.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:40.230
Are you still hesitant?

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:43.640
Is it because I love Buddhist
statues and I'm not a Christian?

00:20:44.240 --> 00:20:47.610
That isn't it. Just that,
if you become my little sister,

00:20:47.610 --> 00:20:50.240
you will become a member
of the Yamayuri Council.

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:53.140
Incidents like what happened
earlier will happen again...

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:54.510
Don't worry.

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:57.280
I think I'll be able to do well.

00:20:57.780 --> 00:21:00.510
It's not like I don't like Rosa Chinensis.

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:03.280
But you were arguing...

00:21:03.460 --> 00:21:05.620
That was admonishing
encouragement offered with love.

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:10.630
Rosa Chinensis sent me out
with a gentle push from behind.

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:13.230
Please take care of Shimako for me.

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:16.000
Sachiko-sama did?

00:21:16.140 --> 00:21:20.510
I think Rosa Chinensis has
accepted me as one of them.

00:21:20.870 --> 00:21:22.410
Because she seems like the sort of person...

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:24.900
...who would totally ignore someone
if they were of no interest to her.

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:27.040
You've been very observant.

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:31.120
Yes, because they're the people that you like.

00:21:41.260 --> 00:21:42.750
So, I can put this on you?

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:46.270
Until you graduate,

00:21:46.270 --> 00:21:48.460
I'll stay fast by your side and never leave you.

00:21:58.880 --> 00:22:00.010
How strange...

00:22:03.180 --> 00:22:05.240
I'm soaking wet, and yet...

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:07.920
...I don't feel cold at all.

00:23:26.730 --> 00:23:27.560
Rose fortune-telling.

00:23:27.770 --> 00:23:29.530
If you like red roses, you are...

00:23:29.640 --> 00:23:30.660
Passionate.

00:23:30.740 --> 00:23:32.440
If you like white roses, you are...

00:23:32.440 --> 00:23:33.410
Spiritual.

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:35.110
If you like yellow roses, you are...

00:23:35.110 --> 00:23:35.970
Out of control.

00:23:36.080 --> 00:23:38.980
It is not as if I go crazy so often.

00:23:39.110 --> 00:23:40.080
Character fortune-telling.

00:23:40.180 --> 00:23:41.420
If you like Yumi, you are...

00:23:41.420 --> 00:23:42.470
Populistic.

00:23:42.620 --> 00:23:43.980
If you like Shimako, you are...

00:23:44.180 --> 00:23:45.050
Intellectual.

00:23:45.050 --> 00:23:46.640
If you like Yoshino, you are...

00:23:46.790 --> 00:23:47.650
A person with unusual tastes.

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:48.880
What?!

00:23:49.290 --> 00:23:49.560
Next time on "Maria Watches Over Us,"

00:23:49.560 --> 00:23:51.560
Next time on "Maria Watches Over Us,"
Next Time "Yellow Rose Weather Advisory"

00:23:51.560 --> 00:23:52.760
"Yellow Rose Weather Advisory".
Next Time "Yellow Rose Weather Advisory"

00:23:52.760 --> 00:23:55.130
I would like to firmly state that I object.
Next Time "Yellow Rose Weather Advisory"

